+# Q3 revenue drop
+
+East had the steepest fall of any region from Q2 to Q3: revenue went from 333,747.57 to 234,325.08, a drop of 29.8% (−99,422.49). The next-worst region, North, fell only 4.3%. Ledger Pro accounts for most of East's drop: its revenue fell from 106,520.77 to 23,015.24 (−83,505.53, about 84% of the region's total decline), then came back to 103,746.42 in Q4. Every other East product moved by less than 8,000, and Audit Add-on grew. Revenue is units × unit_price over completed rows only, with refunds (negative units) included.
+
+| Quarter | East revenue | Change vs previous quarter |
+|---------|-------------:|---------------------------:|
+| Q1      |   333,565.48 |                          — |
+| Q2      |   333,747.57 |                      +0.1% |
+| Q3      |   234,325.08 |                     −29.8% |
+| Q4      |   305,168.76 |                     +30.2% |
